{"id":"n-20261027-due60k","category":"tech","display_title":"Apple iPhone Duo Launch in China","display_title_he":"ההשקה של אייפון דואו בסין","short_summary":"Apple's first foldable phone, the iPhone Duo, drew strong initial demand and high resale offers in China during its global launch, while Apple rolled out iOS 27.2 with new features.","english_level":"C1","words":585,"reading_time":4,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/IPhone_17_launch_at_Apple_TRX_Malaysia_10.jpg/960px-IPhone_17_launch_at_Apple_TRX_Malaysia_10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Ahmad Ali Karim · CC0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:IPhone_17_launch_at_Apple_TRX_Malaysia_10.jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"CNBC","domain":"cnbc.com","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/23/apple-iphone-duo-china-launch.html","title":"Scalpers offer Apple iPhone Duo buyers hundreds extra outside Beijing launch","published_at":"2026-10-23T20:06:37.000Z"},{"name":"The Verge","domain":"theverge.com","url":"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1018827/ios-27-2-iphone-duo-apple-pencil","title":"iPhone Duo now supports Apple Pencil with iOS 27.2","published_at":"2026-10-26T18:51:06.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:06:37.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-27T06:27:39.650Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":9,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Apple recently launched its very first foldable smartphone, the iPhone Duo, which carries an eye-popping price tag. Despite the high cost, initial interest in the device appeared remarkably solid during its global launch on Friday. Outside the flagship store in Beijing's popular Sanlitun shopping area, scalpers like Alex Wang wasted no time positioning themselves to acquire the devices. Some individuals offered to pay customers an extra 3,000 Chinese yuan, equivalent to about $448, to buy their newly purchased phones right on the spot. According to scalpers watching the lines of pre-booked customers, the primary driver behind these aggressive offers was the tight supply, which they believed would allow the Duo to command higher prices for at least half a month. Market analysts from Counterpoint Research point out that while foldables remain a niche product globally, China represents the single largest market for these devices.","Apple fan Mary Tong arrived at the Sanlitun store as early as six in the morning to secure her foldable device as the first person in a line of about one hundred customers. She noted that Apple had previously been a laggard in this category and that many Chinese consumers clearly prefer foldable designs. Local competitors have also been extremely active in the space. Huawei promoted its AI assistant XiaoYi to boost competitiveness and introduced a trifold phone named the Mate XT2 priced at roughly $3,000 on September 7, just two days before Apple's Duo announcement. Meanwhile, Xiaomi unveiled its own expensive foldable, the 18 Fold, around the same time. Apple announced that the Duo would not be available for walk-in purchases on launch day in mainland China and would be strictly limited in other countries, restricting online orders to two phones per transaction. This created delivery timelines stretching all the way to January 2027 for frustrated buyers like Zhang Zheng, who still wanted the device because he felt it would be useful for work and cool to look at, even though customers without a reservation showed up early just to test their luck.","Expectations for Apple Intelligence on the mainland remained relatively subdued. The company stated that a regional version of its AI system is set for beta testing this month to bring features like live translation, writing tools, and photo cleanup to Chinese users. This followed regulatory clearances over the summer and an October 14 approval of Alibaba AI models for use in the Duo and other Apple devices as part of the U.S. tech giant's pending AI rollout. Official media cited ex-CEO Tim Cook's recent China trip regarding revamped Siri AI limitations, while customer John Zhao noted that while he tried Apple Intelligence overseas and found it nice, he expects the Chinese version to be even less exciting.","In related software developments, Apple released iOS 27.2 to bring official Apple Pencil support to the iPhone Duo, an integration previously slated for later in the year. The software update also introduces an Edge Light feature designed to illuminate user faces during video calls across the device's 7.6-inch inner display and 5.4-inch outer screen, utilizing revamped iOS 27 controls. While major apps like Netflix, Prime Video, and Microsoft Outlook already support this extra screen real estate, some apps still require work. Furthermore, iOS 27.2 expands Siri AI to take suggested actions in Messages and adds support for more languages including French, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish, alongside Google's SynthID AI watermark in Photos. The update also enables dual-camera capture during group FaceTime calls so participants can show both selfie and back camera views simultaneously, alongside various other system updates."],"facts":[{"fact":"Apple launched its first foldable phone, the iPhone Duo, with solid initial interest in China.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Scalpers outside the Beijing flagship store in Sanlitun offered customers an extra 3,000 Chinese yuan ($448) to buy their newly purchased phones immediately due to tight supply.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Counterpoint Research notes that China is the single largest market globally for foldable phones, where Apple has faced competition from rivals like Huawei and Xiaomi.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Apple released iOS 27.2, bringing Apple Pencil support to the iPhone Duo along with an 'Edge Light' feature for video calls.","sources":[2]},{"fact":"The iOS 27.2 update also adds Siri AI support in more languages, dual-camera use in group FaceTime calls, and Google's SynthID AI watermark support in Photos.","sources":[2]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Apple","lemma":"Apple","pos":"noun","he":"אפל","name":"Apple"},{"text":"recently","lemma":"recently","pos":"adverb","he":"לאחרונה","name":""},{"text":"launched","lemma":"launch","pos":"verb","he":"השיק","name":""},{"text":"very","lemma":"very","pos":"adverb","he":"מאוד","name":""},{"text":"first","lemma":"first","pos":"adjective","he":"ראשון","name":""},{"text":"foldable","lemma":"foldable","pos":"adjective","he":"מתקפל","name":""},{"text":"smartphone","lemma":"smartphone","pos":"noun","he":"טלפון חכם","name":""},{"text":"iPhone Duo","lemma":"iPhone Duo","pos":"noun","he":"אייפון דואו","name":false},{"text":"carries","lemma":"carry","pos":"verb","he":"נושא","name":""},{"text":"eye-popping","lemma":"eye-popping","pos":"adjective","he":"מדהים / עצום","name":""},{"text":"price tag","lemma":"price tag","pos":"noun","he":"תג מחיר","name":""},{"text":"Despite","lemma":"despite","pos":"preposition","he":"למרות","name":""},{"text":"high","lemma":"high","pos":"adjective","he":"גבוה","name":""},{"text":"cost","lemma":"cost","pos":"noun","he":"עלות","name":""},{"text":"initial","lemma":"initial","pos":"adjective","he":"ראשוני","name":""},{"text":"interest","lemma":"interest","pos":"noun","he":"עניין","name":""},{"text":"device","lemma":"device","pos":"noun","he":"מכשיר","name":""},{"text":"appeared","lemma":"appear","pos":"verb","he":"הופיע / נראה","name":""},{"text":"remarkably","lemma":"remarkably","pos":"adverb","he":"באופן ניכר","name":""},{"text":"solid","lemma":"solid","pos":"adjective","he":"מוצק / איתן","name":""},{"text":"global","lemma":"global","pos":"adjective","he":"גלובלי / עולמי","name":""},{"text":"launch","lemma":"launch","pos":"noun","he":"השקה","name":""},{"text":"Friday","lemma":"Friday","pos":"noun","he":"יום שישי","name":"Friday"},{"text":"Outside","lemma":"outside","pos":"preposition","he":"מחוץ ל","name":""},{"text":"flagship","lemma":"flag